1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:02,055
Walk into any hair-care aisle,

2
00:00:02,075 --> 00:00:04,885
and the labels expect you to already know your hair.

3
00:00:04,985 --> 00:00:08,195
Is it 3B? Is it fine? Is it high porosity?

4
00:00:08,215 --> 00:00:10,906
Honestly, most of us just guess.

5
00:00:11,006 --> 00:00:13,266
So we buy a product, it doesn't work,

6
00:00:13,286 --> 00:00:14,795
and we buy another one.

7
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:16,630
Meet StrandLab.

8
00:00:16,650 --> 00:00:19,275
It measures your hair with YouCam's Hair AI,

9
00:00:19,295 --> 00:00:22,431
and turns those numbers into exactly what to buy.

10
00:00:23,067 --> 00:00:25,967
You take four photos: front, both sides,

11
00:00:25,987 --> 00:00:28,532
and one with your head tipped forward.

12
00:00:28,632 --> 00:00:30,917
The guided camera tracks your face live,

13
00:00:30,937 --> 00:00:32,957
tells you out loud how to move,

14
00:00:32,977 --> 00:00:35,155
and clicks the photo on its own.

15
00:00:35,255 --> 00:00:38,275
Every photo is auto-framed for YouCam's detectors,

16
00:00:38,295 --> 00:00:39,647
so you never get stuck.

17
00:00:40,167 --> 00:00:43,112
Four YouCam APIs run in parallel: Hair Type,

18
00:00:43,132 --> 00:00:46,848
Hair Frizziness, Hair Density and Hair Length Detection.

19
00:00:46,948 --> 00:00:49,768
Meanwhile, I answer what a camera can't see,

20
00:00:49,788 --> 00:00:50,978
like porosity.

21
00:00:51,078 --> 00:00:53,843
And StrandLab checks the dew point in Mumbai,

22
00:00:53,863 --> 00:00:57,728
because humidity changes which ingredients actually work.

23
00:00:58,233 --> 00:01:01,923
Here's my result: 3B to 3C curls, high density,

24
00:01:01,943 --> 00:01:03,563
and a humid week ahead.

25
00:01:03,663 --> 00:01:06,628
So: rich products, hold for my curls,

26
00:01:06,648 --> 00:01:08,983
and skip glycerin on humid days.

27
00:01:09,003 --> 00:01:11,426
Every rule shows the measurement behind it.

28
00:01:11,526 --> 00:01:12,936
And nothing is a black box.

29
00:01:12,956 --> 00:01:14,586
You can see every YouCam call,

30
00:01:14,606 --> 00:01:17,132
and every photo that auto-framing rescued.

31
00:01:17,667 --> 00:01:20,572
The Ingredients tab is my label cheat sheet:

32
00:01:20,592 --> 00:01:23,592
what to look for, what to avoid, and why,

33
00:01:23,612 --> 00:01:25,123
based on my measurements.

34
00:01:25,223 --> 00:01:28,268
The Routine tab turns it into four wash-day steps:

35
00:01:28,288 --> 00:01:30,863
cleanse, condition, leave-in and style,

36
00:01:30,883 --> 00:01:32,151
each with its reason.

37
00:01:32,667 --> 00:01:33,917
Confused by any of it?

38
00:01:33,937 --> 00:01:37,399
The coach explains it in plain words, in 17 languages.

39
00:01:37,499 --> 00:01:38,649
You can even talk to it,

40
00:01:38,669 --> 00:01:40,570
and have the answers read out loud.

41
00:01:41,200 --> 00:01:43,885
Then, shopping. A ranked starter kit,

42
00:01:43,905 --> 00:01:46,445
and real product links for your own country.

43
00:01:46,545 --> 00:01:47,535
Standing in a store?

44
00:01:47,555 --> 00:01:49,915
Just photograph the bottle's ingredient list,

45
00:01:49,935 --> 00:01:52,641
and StrandLab tells you if it suits your hair.

46
00:01:53,167 --> 00:01:56,325
And YouCam's Hair Volume try-on shows what this routine

47
00:01:56,345 --> 00:01:59,473
can realistically do, right next to the ad promise.

48
00:02:00,200 --> 00:02:02,435
Now, the big one for e-commerce.

49
00:02:02,455 --> 00:02:06,196
Any online store can add StrandLab with one line of code.

50
00:02:06,296 --> 00:02:09,756
The shopper taps "Find my hair match", matches once,

51
00:02:09,776 --> 00:02:12,782
and every product on the page shows how well it suits

52
00:02:12,802 --> 00:02:13,292
them.

53
00:02:13,392 --> 00:02:15,237
The store gets the result as an event.

54
00:02:15,257 --> 00:02:18,156
And the shopper's photos never leave StrandLab.

55
00:02:18,967 --> 00:02:22,837
StrandLab is also a PWA. Install it from your browser,

56
00:02:22,857 --> 00:02:25,685
and it opens full screen, just like a real app.

57
00:02:25,785 --> 00:02:28,030
It's on your home screen in the store aisle,

58
00:02:28,050 --> 00:02:29,575
uses your phone's camera,

59
00:02:29,595 --> 00:02:32,003
and still opens when the network drops.

60
00:02:32,533 --> 00:02:35,028
No camera, or don't want to share a selfie?

61
00:02:35,048 --> 00:02:38,044
The no-photo check builds your plan from four picture

62
00:02:38,064 --> 00:02:38,820
questions.

63
00:02:38,920 --> 00:02:41,480
There's bigger text, a high-contrast mode,

64
00:02:41,500 --> 00:02:42,675
voice in and out,

65
00:02:42,695 --> 00:02:45,689
and you can send your plan to your stylist instantly.

66
00:02:46,400 --> 00:02:49,965
Your hair, measured by YouCam, explained in plain words,

67
00:02:49,985 --> 00:02:51,499
and ready for any store.

68
00:02:51,599 --> 00:02:56,380
This is StrandLab. Try it free at strandlab-youcam.vercel.app
